    "detailed_description": "BeatPunk! is a top-down arena shooter roguelike where you play as a musician trying to survive a horde of robots by composing deadly songs. Choose from a variety of weapons, traits and sounds where each choice results in a different song and playstyle, making each playthrough unique.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/024ef20fe0b2220caf9e21eb7ed2d67b.poster.avif?t=1749464475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/024ef20fe0b2220caf9e21eb7ed2d67b.webm?t=1749464475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/024ef20fe0b2220caf9e21eb7ed2d67b.mp4?t=1749464475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the distant future, the demand for musical entertainment has evolved. People have realized that the most unique songs come from musicians that are fighting for their lives. Hence, musicians fight against a horde of killer robots in order to prove that they are the best of the best, both at surviving and at composing. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/dd7481ef15eebcdddf722deea7990ed8.poster.avif?t=1749464475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/dd7481ef15eebcdddf722deea7990ed8.webm?t=1749464475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/dd7481ef15eebcdddf722deea7990ed8.mp4?t=1749464475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use your weaponized instruments to fight a horde of robots and to prove your worth as the best musician. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 instruments <br></li><li>16 skills<br></li><li>150+ sound combinations to compose deadly music that evolves as you get stronger</li></ul><br>Pick different skill and sound combinations and make unique songs each playthrough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/06beda19a4b8341d1b4626701b799998.poster.avif?t=1749464475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/06beda19a4b8341d1b4626701b799998.webm?t=1749464475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205610/extras/06beda19a4b8341d1b4626701b799998.mp4?t=1749464475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
